      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need help with something weird. i've been losing access to my accounts one by one. first my old forum profile just vanished—\"user not found\" even though i know the login is right—and now my secondary email is acting like it was wiped. it doesn't feel like a hack or a password issue... it feels like someone is systematically scrubbing my digital footprint. can you help me look for patterns or see if there's a way to track what's actually happening?",
